<title>UK: UK meals/feeds continue to follow Chicago's lead.</title>
<headline>UK meals/feeds continue to follow Chicago's lead.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK meals and feeds sellers took their cue from the Chicago market and marked up prices on Friday.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal was up around one stg across the board but buyers did not follow.</p>
<p>Trading was limited to spot rapemeal which fetched 122 stg a tonne in the Liverpool area.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
